            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.14.1+JOS.14.2+JOS.14.3+JOS.14.4+JOS.14.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoc 14:1-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Musa ng’olo ni nyithindho mir Israel, ewacu kumae, Maeni ng’om ma wubimaku ku gagi, ma Yehova ng’olo ya jumi ni suru abung’wen, man ni ng’et suru: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kum suru mi nyithindho pa Ruben calku udi pa weggi, man suru mi nyithindho pa Gad Calku udi pa weggi, gimaku, man ng’et suru pa Manase maku, aba migi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "suru ario ku ng’et suru gimaku aba migi loka Yordan, ba Yeriko yo nyangu, yo ku wokceng’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova yero ni Musa, ewacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni nying’ dhanu ma bipoko ng’om iwu ni aba: Eleazar ma jalam, man Yocuwa ma wod Nun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man wugam jaditmawijo acel ku ba sum, upok ng’om ni aba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E maeni gi nying’ dhanune: Mi suru pa Yuda, Kaleb ma wod Yefune. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man mi suru mi nyithindho pa Simeon, Cemuel ma wod Amihud. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi suru pa Benyamin, Elidad ma wod Kislon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man mi suru mi nyithindho pa Dan jaditmawijo, Buki ma wod Yogli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi nyithindho pa Yusuf; mi suru mi nyithindho pa Manase jaditmawijo, Haniel ma wod Efod, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man mi suru mi nyithindho pa Efraim jaditmawijo, Kemuel ma wod Ciftan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man mi suru mi nyithindho pa Zebulun jaditmawijo, Elizafan ma wod Parnak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man mi suru mi nyithindho pa Isakar jaditmawijo, Paltiel ma wod Azan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man mi suru mi nyithindho pa Acer jaditmawijo, Ahihud ma wod Celomi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man mi suru mi nyithindho pa Naftali jaditmawijo, Pedahel ma wod Amihud. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni ju ma Yehova ng’olo ya upok aba ni nyithindho mir Israel i ng’om Kanan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
